From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike West <mkwst@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 01:15:22 -0700
Subject: [Web Bundles] Support signature-based SRI.

When implementing Signature-based SRI, we missed the web bundle
URLLoader specialization. This CL ensures that the relevant headers are
processed in `WebBundleURLLoaderFactory::SendResponseToLoader`, and adds
unit and web platform tests to lock in the behavior.

Bug: 566857543
Change-Id: Id3497f215e1916a67287484a7eb2ab2aa4db404e
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8548513
Commit-Queue: Mike West <mkwst@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Kenichi Ishibashi <bashi@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1716596}

